  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://todaygoodaction.org/yellowfish/?idx=21\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">물살이의 길 : 오늘의행동 사회적협동조합 (todaygoodaction.org)</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"물살이의 길 : 오늘의행동 사회적협동조합\" data-og-description=\"담배꽁초와 미세 플라스틱에 던지는 질문 &#160;&#160;&#160;&quot;아빠 아빠 수돗물은 어디서 와?&quot;&quot;아빠 아빠 변기물은 어디로 가?&quot;&quot;음 우리가 쓰는 물은... 다시 땅으로 강으로 바다로 그리고 다시 증발해 하늘로 \" data-og-host=\"todaygoodaction.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://todaygoodaction.org/yellowfish/?idx=21\" data-og-url=\"https://todaygoodaction.org/yellowfish/?idx=21\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bCYGbu/hyP6EFdYkk/iD5lq9XcYcLQoa99wtb9xk/img.jpg?width=750&amp;height=750&amp;face=0_0_750_750\"><a href=\"https://todaygoodaction.org/yellowfish/?idx=21\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://todaygoodaction.org/yellowfish/?idx=21\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bCYGbu/hyP6EFdYkk/iD5lq9XcYcLQoa99wtb9xk/img.jpg?width=750&amp;height=750&amp;face=0_0_750_750)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">물살이의 길 : 오늘의행동 사회적협동조합</p><p class=\"og-desc\">담배꽁초와 미세 플라스틱에 던지는 질문 &#160;&#160;&#160;&quot;아빠 아빠 수돗물은 어디서 와?&quot;&quot;아빠 아빠 변기물은 어디로 가?&quot;&quot;음 우리가 쓰는 물은... 다시 땅으로 강으로 바다로 그리고 다시 증발해 하늘로 </p><p class=\"og-host\">todaygoodaction.org</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">오늘의 행동 물살이의 길 행동구독을&#160;<br>알게 되어 이 수업을 해보았습니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br>아이들에게 우리 일상에서 흔히 보는,<br>그러나 무슨 용도인지 잘 알지 못했던&#160;<br>빗물받이에 대해 알려줍니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br>이 곳을 통해 나가는 담배꽁초들이&#160;<br>바다까지 흘러가고&#160;<br>우리의 몸으로 그 미세플라스틱들이 다시 돌아올 수 있음을 이야기해줍니다.</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvfemdfvamm2d1diryhyu8q7s@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvfemdfvamm2d1diryhyu8q7s/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33222323283&amp;signature=SeVKWo0quiy%2FAK6m8ZiSx7w0flE%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvfemdfvamm2d1diryhyu8q7s?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2ZmVtZGZ2YW1tMmQxZGlyeWh5dThxN3MiLCJ0aWQiOiIxMzI4M2ZhMi04Y2QzLTQ4ZWUtYWRhNC0yM2VjMzY5YmJiYzYiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODA5OTN9.J_B_p_9yHeJitrxpexH0kLfQTKzKkfgDTbDJdDGW-qiIHvYBUjgb34rm6wem7FSIAFTFraqKHihnnUEHpDi7zg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>미세플라스틱의 위해성에 관한<br>이야기도 나눈 뒤에<br>빗물받이 주변을 도색하기 위한<br>이정표를 만드는 시간을 줍니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br>4인 1조로 하여,&#160;<br>4명의 작품이 모여 하나의 작품을&#160;<br>이룰 수 있게 만들어보게 했어요.<br>&#160;<br>이정표는 OHP필름을 이용해 만들고,&#160;<br>도색은 분필로 했습니다.&#160;<br>(이정표는 오늘의 행동 사이트에서&#160;<br>살 수도 있어요.)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05710f1601ae5eb7a07fcb590d5ed5f5d24fd255\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05710f1601ae5eb7a07fcb590d5ed5f5d24fd255\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6ee5461ba6f0ddc8ae1b6e0ef195391b9db7fe96\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6ee5461ba6f0ddc8ae1b6e0ef195391b9db7fe96\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7e03c40b0718cd35a50524f099ec1495a3110b5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7e03c40b0718cd35a50524f099ec1495a3110b5\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5071cd6fbfe8c97fd0629fe715094bbc058a1fe7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5071cd6fbfe8c97fd0629fe715094bbc058a1fe7\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/044e71f2a9a163ca294caa7ed05c8382a6a5de62\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/044e71f2a9a163ca294caa7ed05c8382a6a5de62\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/733ce7de7b995bc8e8d432a4bd542729e30cfda0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/733ce7de7b995bc8e8d432a4bd542729e30cfda0\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3c9ef856f5800eaebf40046407d006162d4c11bd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3c9ef856f5800eaebf40046407d006162d4c11bd\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a7008e1376011e561048420a677c6b01fdbbf5b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a7008e1376011e561048420a677c6b01fdbbf5b\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a4a9c3173883adeab52602596e64ff78d0a84f8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a4a9c3173883adeab52602596e64ff78d0a84f8\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>학교 주변 빗물받이에&#160;<br>도색 작업 활동을 하며 다녔는데,<br>힘들기는 했지만<br>뿌듯해 하더라고요.<br>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>밤에 학원 끝나고 그 길을 지나면서&#160;<br>동아리 단톡방에 사진 찍어 올리는 남학생도 있었어요.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/acc17bcfd5dcf4d635885f320dc6025ec7c048fc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/acc17bcfd5dcf4d635885f320dc6025ec7c048fc\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1d397d46fa4f8393dcb1c20531a44881cab354b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1d397d46fa4f8393dcb1c20531a44881cab354b\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9101fc483041dc266f184a990629f54fb183c0c7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9101fc483041dc266f184a990629f54fb183c0c7\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>&#160;저도 이번 수업을 통해&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">빗물받이에 대해 알게 되었네요.&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
